---
// Hidden attribution fields, shared by both lead forms (Contact.astro on the
// homepage, lp/LpLeadForm.astro on the campaign pages).
//
// They must exist in the STATIC html: Netlify Forms registers a form's fields
// from the markup it sees at deploy time, so a field injected by script alone
// would be dropped from the submission.
//
// Filled by applySource() in src/scripts/leadSource.js, which reads the source
// captured on the first page of the visit. Empty values are normal in local dev
// and on a hard-refreshed form; they never block a submit.
---

<input type="hidden" name="source" data-source-field="source" value="" />
<input type="hidden" name="referrer" data-source-field="referrer" value="" />
<input type="hidden" name="landing_page" data-source-field="landing_page" value="" />
